@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+{
+  "file": "src/agents.ts",
+  "snippet": "maxTurns: 0,",
+  "cause": "The triage agent was defined with maxTurns: 0, so Genkit aborts as soon as its model tries to call a delegation tool (the check is currentTurn + 1 > maxIterations), while greetings that need no tool call still succeed.",
+  "evidence": "Before the fix, tryTriage('hello') returned a greeting but tryTriage('Where is order A-1001?') threw 'ABORTED: Exceeded maximum tool call iterations (0)'; the check is in node_modules/@genkit-ai/ai/lib/generate/action.mjs:346-354 and defineAgent passes maxTurns through to generate. After changing it to maxTurns: 4, the same question returned the correct shipped status, ETA and tracking code."
+}
